category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gengetopt libcurl-devel libedit-devel libpcsclite-devel libssl-devel libusb1.0-devel
sdesc: "Thin wrapper around libyubihsm providing both an interactive and command-line interface to a YubiHSM (utilities)"
ldesc: "This repository contains most of the components used to interact with the
YubiHSM 2 at both a user-facing and programmatic level."
